# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P1, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0. Everything is
# set before the recording (the recipe's moves reach the same settings, the reverb at 40); the clip is the bells.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap EDIT
turn K1 -40 60
turn K3 -40 60
tap HOME
tap HOME
turn K1 35 60
turn K3 36 60
tap ARP
tap ARP
tap HOME
turn K2 30 60
turn K4 30 60
wait 1500
tapkey b10
tapkey b10
set 43 70
set 48 4
set 47 103
set 16 1
set 37 1
set 17 -100
set 38 -100
set 7 400
set 28 400
set 63 40
wait 500
wav bells.wav
# @ A bell struck every 2.5 s: bright and clangy on the hit, then the top dies first and it fades into a dark hum
wait 14000
wavstop
page 7
wait 400
shot bells-0.png
page 6
wait 400
shot bells-1.png
